      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Two faults: the worker is currently stuck since t=619 (runtime fault, needs restart) leaving 359 messages unprocessed, and the earlier bad deploy of worker v1.0.1 left ~509 orders orphaned with no live message (needs requeue)."
}
